{"id":"b976bcf8c91e6a60","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Tree Body","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body — ZFC Descriptive3 Tree Body","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body — ZFC Descriptive3 Tree Body","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body — ZFC Descriptive3 Tree Body"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\">\\([T]\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s,t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\\,\\subseteq(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})^2\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\,\\subseteq(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})^2\\)</span> (initial-segment relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3TreeBody}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3TreeBody}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash s\\sqsubseteq t\\leftrightarrow s,t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash s\\sqsubseteq t\\leftrightarrow s,t\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}tree\\text{-}body} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3TreeBody}_S(T,[T])\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,\\sqsubseteq\\cap(T\\times T))\\land [T]=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}tree\\text{-}body} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3TreeBody}_S(T,[T])\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,\\sqsubseteq\\cap(T\\times T))\\land [T]=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The global initial-segment relation is restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times T\">\\(T\\times T\\)</span> before it is passed to the two-place tree predicate; otherwise it is not a relation on the advertised carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-tree]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"[T]\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq\\,\\subseteq(\\omega^{<\\omega})^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3TreeBody}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash s\\sqsubseteq t\\leftrightarrow s,t\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land t\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}tree\\text{-}body} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3TreeBody}_S(T,[T])\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,\\sqsubseteq\\cap(T\\times T))\\land [T]=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"T\\times T","display":false}],"bytes":1457,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1834","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive3-tree-body]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f06e57c5c0b1354d"]}